        "en": "Task/execution, tri-state precheck and permissions; replace needs instance/plugin delete support and Provider; unsupported wins. Describe preserves Meta types and runtime protection adds no grants. Reviewed existing worker split, encoded/raw-copy distinctions, CDC scans and runtime-policy references retain stopped native creation: no execution, schedule or scan; encoded execution remains unmodeled."
