        "en": "Watermark incremental load is not modeled in this capability"
      },
      "sources": [
        "config"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "transfer.execution",
      "state": "not_modeled",
      "summary": {
        "zh-cn": "该创建能力不包含执行；运行审批与结果查询由独立 transfer.task.start 和 transfer.execution.get 能力声明，不继承创建确认。",
        "en": "This creation capability excludes execution; independent transfer.task.start and transfer.execution.get describe owner-approved running and observation, without inheriting creation review."
      },
      "sources": [
        "config"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "transfer.encoded",
      "state": "not_modeled",
      "summary": {
        "zh-cn": "文件、对象与 raw copy 传输尚未纳入本能力定义",
