        "zh-cn": "当前第一方 User 的角色专用字段方式、手动 EA 执行及导出交付尚未纳入本委托创建能力；不借用发布人、服务或委托人角色。",
        "en": "Current first-party User role-specific field choices, manual EA execution and export delivery are not modeled by this delegated creation capability; publisher, service or delegator roles are not borrowed."
